m and the conditions, the polynomial \\( g(x) \\) is scaled down in magnitude at the positive roots and adjusted symmetrically at the negative roots.\n\nThus, the polynomial \\( g(x) \\) simplifies such that \\( |g(0)| = 12 \\). Therefore, the answer is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{12}\n\\]",
